{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">
        <img src="assets/img/pattern.svg" alt="" class="logo-pattern">
        <span class="business">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
          <li><a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a></li>
          <li><a href="approach.html">Approach</a></li>
          <li><a href="fees.html">Fees</a></li>
          <li><a href="faq.html">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="book.html" class="cta-link">Book</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="hero">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Clearer Steps, Calmer Days</h1>
          <p class="lead">{{TAGLINE}} — I support adults navigating life changes, anxiety, grief, and relational challenges with practical strategies and compassionate coaching.</p>
          <div class="hero-cta">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button class="btn outline" id="open-modal">Request a consult</button>
          </div>
          <ul class="quick-meta">
            <li><strong>{{THERAPIST_NAME}}</strong>, {{LICENSE}}</li>
            <li>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</li>
            <li class="conf">Confidential care; telehealth &amp; in-person</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <img src="assets/img/hero.svg" alt="Abstract warm shapes" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story" id="story">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>My clinical story</h2>
        <p>I blend evidence-informed approaches with a warm, playful stance to help you find footing during uncertain seasons. I trained in trauma-informed CBT, integrate somatic awareness, and emphasize collaborative goal setting. My work centers on practical skills you can use between sessions — I value transparency about scope, limits, and expected pace of change.</p>
        <p class="note">Confidentiality: sessions are private and protected under applicable laws. I do not provide emergency services. If you are in immediate danger, call local emergency services or a crisis line.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="framework" id="framework">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>How I work: a three-track framework</h2>
        <div class="tracks">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Stabilize</h3>
            <p>Short-term tools to reduce distress: grounding, breath work, sleep habits, and behavioral scheduling.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Understand</h3>
            <p>Explore patterns, core beliefs, and relational cycles with curiosity — we map how past experiences shape present reactions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Practice</h3>
            <p>Build skills into daily life: exposure, communication rehearsal, self-compassion practices, and relapse planning.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="programs" id="programs">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Support Paths</h2>
        <p class="intro">I offer short and longer-term pathways depending on need.</p>
        <div class="program-grid">
          <div class="program">
            <h3>Compass: Brief Support</h3>
            <p>4–6 sessions focused on immediate stabilization and a clear action plan. Good for acute stress, decision points, or guidance.</p>
            <ul><li>Telehealth available</li><li>Simple homework &amp; check-ins</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="program">
            <h3>Harbor: Ongoing Work</h3>
            <p>Open-ended weekly sessions for deeper processing around trauma, relationships, or persistent anxiety.</p>
            <ul><li>Integrated somatic &amp; cognitive work</li><li>Periodic progress reviews</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="program">
            <h3>Bridge: Couples &amp; Communication</h3>
            <p>Focused sessions to improve listening, boundary setting, and conflict patterns for partners.</p>
            <ul><li>Structured exercises in-session</li><li>Referral network for couples needing specialized care</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Fees & booking</h2>
        <p>Sliding scale and limited reduced-fee slots available. I am transparent about cost during an initial call.</p>
        <div class="pricing-grid">
          <div class="price-card">
            <h3>Intro Consult</h3>
            <p class="price">$25 — 20 minute intake &amp; question call</p>
            <p>Good for deciding if we'll work together.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card">
            <h3>Standard Session</h3>
            <p class="price">$160 — 50 minutes</p>
            <p>Regular session with therapeutic work and skill-building.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price-card">
            <h3>Extended</h3>
            <p class="price">$210 — 80 minutes</p>
            <p>For deeper exploration or couples work.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="payment-note">I accept major cards; insurance may be used out-of-network. Cancellation policy: 48 hours notice preferred.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials" id="testimonials">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>What people say</h2>
        <div class="test-grid">
          <blockquote>
            <p>“Therapist helped me find tools that fit my life — gentle, direct, and practical.”</p>
            <cite>— A., client</cite>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote>
            <p>“I felt seen and learned new ways to manage panic. The sessions were hopeful without pressure.”</p>
            <cite>— R., client</cite>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta" id="cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready to start?</h2>
        <p>If you're curious about working together, {{THERAPIST_NAME}} offers a brief consult to answer questions and review fit.</p>
        <a class="btn primary large" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div>
          <p><strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong><br>{{THERAPIST_NAME}} — {{LICENSE}}<br>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
          <p>Privacy &amp; confidentiality: Sessions are protected; notes are stored securely.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>Practice scope: I work with adults on anxiety, trauma, relationship issues, burnout, grief, and life transitions. I do not offer emergency care.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p><a href="contact.html">Contact</a> · <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></p>
          <p class="small">Phone: {{PHONE}} · Email: {{EMAIL}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="disclaimer">Not a replacement for medical advice. If you are experiencing an emergency, call local emergency services.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div id="modal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title">
      <button class="modal-close" id="close-modal" aria-label="Close">×</button>
      <h3 id="modal-title">Request a consult</h3>
      <form id="consult-form">
        <label>Name<input type="text" name="name" required></label>
        <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" required></label>
        <label>Phone<input type="tel" name="phone"></label>
        <label>Preferred times<textarea name="notes"></textarea></label>
        <div class="form-actions">
          <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send</button>
          <button class="btn outline" type="button" id="cancel-modal">Cancel</button>
        </div>
        <p class="privacy-small">By submitting you agree to contact about services. Confidentiality and limits discussed in first session.</p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"}
